### Component 3: Challenge Center Screen

#### [MODIFY] [progress_screen.dart](file:///c:/Flutter_Projects/my_ada/my_ada/lib/features/progress/presentation/screens/progress_screen.dart)

**Full replacement** of file contents. The `ProgressScreen` class is kept (name preserved) but completely rebuilt.

#### Data Models (at the top of the file)

```dart
// Mock data models — ready to be wired to AppDatabase/ScoringEngine
class _ChallengeData { title, subtitle, progress (0.0–1.0), status, accentColor, iconBg, iconFg, pillBg, pillFg, pointsLabel }
class _RetakeData    { title, score, scoreColor, reason, buttonLabel }
class _NextExamData  { comingUpLabel, title, subtitle, readinessPercent, ctaLabel }
```

Mock instances placed as `static const` lists in the `ProgressScreen` class.

#### Widget Tree Structure

```
ProgressScreen (StatelessWidget)
└── Scaffold
    └── SafeArea
        └── CustomScrollView
            ├── SliverToBoxAdapter → _ChallengeHeader
            ├── SliverToBoxAdapter → _StatsRow
            └── SliverList content (padded)
                ├── _SectionHeader("Timed challenges", "3 pending")
                ├── _ChallengeCard × 3  (Functions, Logic Flow, Debugging)
                ├── _Divider
                ├── _SectionHeader("Retake suggestions", "2 quizzes")
                ├── _RetakeCard × 2  (Conditionals, Variables)
                ├── _Divider
                ├── _SectionHeader("Next exam", "Module 3")
                └── _NextExamCard
```

#### Private Widget Components

| Widget | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `_ChallengeHeader` | Title + subtitle, mirrors learn_screen.dart header |
| `_StatsRow` | 3-column `Row` of `_StatBox` widgets, white bg with border-bottom |
| `_StatBox` | Label, colored value, sub-label — no fixed widths, uses `Expanded` |
| `_SectionHeader` | Bold section title + gray count label in a `Row` |
| `_ChallengeCard` | Icon circle + body (title, sub, progress bar) + right (pill + pts) |
| `_StatusPill` | Rounded pill with themed bg/text colors |
| `_ProgressBar` | Thin 3px bar with colored fill (no `LinearProgressIndicator` — custom for exact height) |
| `_RetakeCard` | Title + score row, reason text, full-width action button |
| `_NextExamCard` | Green card with readiness bar and "Start early" button |
| `_HorizontalDivider` | Thin `Divider` matching wireframe's `0.5px #eee` |

